<p>You have a special affinity for darkness and shadows.</p><p>When standing in an unlit grid, the minimum range to your foes for activating stealth or for maintaining it after a Shadow Dance is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4.</acronym></p><p>While stealthed, your life regeneration is increased by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">5.5, 6.8, 8.0, 9.0, 10</acronym> (based on your Cunning) and your stamina regeneration is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.0, 1.5, 1.9, 2.2, 2.5.</acronym>  The regeneration effects persist for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 4</acronym> turns after exiting stealth, with 5 times the normal rate.</p>